      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "3. Place the egg whites into a large metal bowl. Using an electric whisk, whisk on medium speed for about 1 minute. The egg whites will turn to foam and grow in volume. Increase to a high speed and continue whisking until soft peaks begin to form."
