      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "4. Still whisking, add the sugar gradually, a few spoonfuls at a time, whisking for  20 - 30 seconds between each addition. Continue to whisk until the whites are eight times their original volumes, the sugar has dissolved and the mixture is stiff and shiny. Touch the foam with your finger - if it feels gritty keep whisking. The mixture is ready for baking when it doesn’t slide off a spoon and it holds it’s shape."
    },
